# Every text file is checked out with LF, whatever Git's default on the system (Git for Windows
# checks text out with CRLF): check:build compares worker.js byte for byte, and the browser modules
# are embedded in it as JSON strings of their source files, so a clone with CRLF would fail the
# check untouched and rebuild a worker.js that differs from CI's (development 6).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
